      "answer": "Click or tap any key to insert its Persian character into the text box, or type directly on your physical QWERTY keyboard and the matching Persian letters will appear. Hold Shift to reach vowel diacritics (like َ, ِ, ُ) and extra punctuation, then copy the result to use anywhere you need Persian text.",
